  "label": "Textual entity 'wife' mapped onto visual entity 'woman'",
  "description": "The text refers to 'your fifth wife', which is an explicit textual entity. However, no woman is visually present in the image. Therefore, there is no direct visual entity to which the textual entity 'wife' can be mapped. The meme relies on the absence of a visual representation of the 'wife' to create a contrast with the visual of men embracing, which amplifies the offensive nature of the text. The mapping is therefore non-existent in the visual material, as the text refers to a non-present entity.",
